{"data":[{"id":9545,"title":"Bài tập 1: Sửa lỗi Hardcode URL trong RestTemplate của order-service","description":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:18pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài tập 1: Sửa lỗi Hardcode URL trong RestTemplate của order-service</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Cấp độ: Vận dụng cơ bản</strong></span></i></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1. Mục tiêu kiến thức</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nắm vững cách cấu hình RestTemplate đúng chuẩn: dùng service-id thay vì hardcode IP:port, đặt timeout, và tạo bean @LoadBalanced.</span></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>2. Tình huống nghiệp vụ</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Một thực tập sinh của VietMart vừa viết lớp ProductServiceClientRT trong order-service. Code chạy tốt trên máy dev nhưng báo lỗi khi deploy lên staging. Đoạn code đang có vấn đề:</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"table\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-style:none;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\" width=\"576\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt;\"><td style=\"background-color:#f3f3f3;overflow-wrap:break-word;overflow:hidden;padding:0pt 5.75pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">// ProductServiceClientRT.java — CODE ĐANG CÓ LỖI</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">@Component</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">public class ProductServiceClientRT {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// LOI 1: khong dung @LoadBalanced RestTemplate — khong qua Eureka</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;private final RestTemplate restTemplate = new RestTemplate();</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;public ProductInfo getById(Long productId) {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// LOI 2: hardcode IP:port thay vi dung service-id</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;String url = \"http://192.168.1.45:8082/api/products/{id}\";</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// LOI 3: khong co timeout — thread co the bi block mai mai</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return restTemplate.getForObject(url, ProductInfo.class, productId);</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">}</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>3. Yêu cầu của bài tập</strong></span></span></h1><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Xác định và giải thích cả ba lỗi trong đoạn code trên, nêu rõ hậu quả cụ thể của từng lỗi khi chạy trong môi trường production có nhiều instance.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Viết lại lớp ProductServiceClientRT đúng chuẩn: tạo bean RestTemplate riêng có @LoadBalanced, cấu hình connectTimeout=2s và readTimeout=3s, dùng service-id \"product-service\" thay vì IP cứng.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thêm xử lý lỗi phân biệt rõ ResourceAccessException (timeout) và HttpClientErrorException.NotFound (404): mỗi trường hợp xử lý khác nhau.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Viết 2 unit test bằng JUnit + Mockito: một test gọi thành công, một test mô phỏng timeout và kiểm tra fallback được trả về.</span></span></li></ul><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>4. Kết quả mong muốn</strong></span></span></h1><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Code sau khi sửa không còn hardcode IP, có @LoadBalanced, có timeout.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hai unit test chạy pass, kiểm chứng cả happy path và fallback path.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Giải thích ba lỗi rõ ràng, đúng kỹ thuật.</span></span></li></ul><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>5. Hướng dẫn nộp bài</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nộp file mã nguồn Java (.java) kèm bộ test và một báo cáo ngắn (.pdf hoặc .docx) mô tả từng lỗi và cách khắc phục, qua hệ thống nộp bài lớp.</span></span><br>&nbsp;</p>","createdBy":"49","createdAt":"2026-07-14T01:44:34.000Z","updatedAt":null,"updatedBy":null,"status":1,"position":7109,"tutorial":"","gradingCriteria":"# Tiêu chí chấm điểm — Bài tập 1: Sửa lỗi Hardcode URL trong RestTemplate của order-service\n\n_Vận dụng cơ bản | Thang điểm: 100_\n\n| Tiêu chí | Mô tả chi tiết | Điểm |\n|---|---|---|\n| Xác định 3 lỗi | Giải thích đúng và đủ hậu quả của từng lỗi trong production. | 30 |\n| Sửa đúng RestTemplate bean | Bean có @LoadBalanced, timeout đúng, service-id thay IP. | 30 |\n| Xử lý lỗi phân biệt | Phân biệt ResourceAccessException vs HttpClientErrorException đúng. | 20 |\n| Unit test | 2 test pass, cover happy path và fallback. | 20 |\n| **Tổng** | | **100** |","sampleLink":"","expectedTime":60},{"id":9546,"title":"Bài tập 2: Chuyển đổi ProductServiceClientRT sang FeignClient","description":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:18pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài tập 2: Chuyển đổi ProductServiceClientRT sang FeignClient</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Cấp độ: Vận dụng cơ bản/chuyên sâu</strong></span></i></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1. Mục tiêu kiến thức</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thực hành chuyển đổi từ cách gọi imperative (RestTemplate) sang declarative (FeignClient), đồng thời cấu hình FallbackFactory xử lý lỗi đầy đủ.</span></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:24pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#1f3a5f;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>2. Tình huống nghiệp vụ</strong></span></span></h1><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sau khi sửa xong ProductServiceClientRT ở Bài tập 1, đội trưởng yêu cầu chuyển sang FeignClient để đồng bộ với phong cách code của cả team. Ngoài ra, cần bổ sung thêm UserClient để order-service lấy thông tin người mua. Lớp RestTemplate cũ (đã đúng từ Bài tập 1) có code như sau để tham khảo:</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"table\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-style:none;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\" width=\"576\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt;\"><td style=\"background-color:#f3f3f3;overflow-wrap:break-word;overflow:hidden;padding:0pt 5.75pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">// ProductServiceClientRT.java (đã đúng từ Bài tập 1 — chỉ để tham khảo)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">@Component</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">public class ProductServiceClientRT {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;private final RestTemplate restTemplate;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;public ProductServiceClientRT(@LoadBalanced RestTemplate restTemplate) {</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;this.restTemplate = restTemplate;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-col